WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.146 --> 00:00:05.955
Maya has a mountain of notes, and no idea what they say!

3
00:00:06.564 --> 00:00:09.830
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.917
This is Episode 78.

5
00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:15.283
Meet the library.

6
00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:19.324
The sticky-pot cleans the cards and stacks them neat.

7
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:22.964
The river chute brings new cards as they come.

8
00:00:23.574 --> 00:00:27.477
The reading lamp finds the answer in a pile, no sorting needed.

9
00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:31.189
The pointer bird darts to the one card you want.

10
00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:35.123
The ant crew moves a whole mountain of cards in minutes.

11
00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:39.035
The tall tower keeps millions in tiny drawers.

12
00:00:39.644 --> 00:00:42.580
And the easel paints the answer as a picture.

13
00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:50.856
That is AWS analytics: Glue, Kinesis, Athena, OpenSearch, EMR, Redshift and QuickSight.

14
00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:53.505
Now you know the library!

15
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

